  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "长，气压随海面以上高度的变化而变化以及其他过程，都可以",
        "用 $y=a^x$ 这种形式的公式描述，这里 $a$ 是大于零的某一个数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用 $y=a^x$（$a$ 是某一个正",
        "数）这种形式的公式给出的函",
        "数，叫做指数函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 74",
      "box": [
        1364,
        635,
        784,
        1395
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-74"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在前一小节里，我们讨论",
        "了在实数集合上给出的指数函",
        "数 $y=2^x$ 的性质. 在实数集合",
        "上给出的任何一个函数 $y=a^x$",
        "（$a$ 是大于1的某一个数）都具",
        "有类似的性质*."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图74中作出了 $y=a^x$ 这种",
        "形式的函数在几个大于1的 $a$",
        "值下（$y=3^x$，$y=1.3^x$，$y=4.5^x$）",
        "的图象. 其中每一个函数的图",
        "象和函数 $y=2^x$ 的图象都是类"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 74",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "似的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来简单说明当 $a>1$ 时函数 $y=a^x$（$x\\in R$）的性质."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 函数的值域是正数集合，也就是函数只取正值，并且",
        "任何一个正数都是函数的值. 在几何上，这表示当 $a>1$ 时函",
        "数 $y=a^x$ 的图象位于 $x$ 轴的上方，而且任何一条平行于 $x$ 轴",
        "并且在 $x$ 轴上方的直线，都和这个图象相交."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 这种函数是增函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "* 也象 $a=2$ 的情形一样，我们将不作证明而承认这种函数存在."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "197"
      ]
    }
  ]
